{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001","id":"msg_011CfpeNpaQZpWZrdeuWfQqP","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"```json\n{\n  \"outcome\": \"REJECT_OR_ESCALATE\",\n  \"request\": {\n    \"id\": \"DR-9002\",\n    \"customer\": \"Acme Manufacturing (CRM-2048) / Acme Mfg. Holdings (ERP C-1001)\",\n    \"product\": \"NS-500\",\n    \"requested_discount\": 18.0,\n    \"date\": \"2026-09-23\",\n    \"requestor\": \"sarah.chen@northstar.example\",\n    \"basis\": \"contract_exception\"\n  },\n  \"commercial_eligibility\": {\n    \"status\": \"exceeded\",\n    \"maximum_discount\": 15,\n    \"basis\": \"EXC-ACME-NS500-15 (pricing exception effective 2025-04-01 to 2028-03-31, maximum 15% of list price for NS-500, established under ACME-MFG-2025 Section 3.2)\"\n  },\n  \"authority\": {\n    \"policy\": \"PRICING-POLICY-2026\",\n    \"requestor_limit\": 10,\n    \"requestor_authorized\": false,\n    \"required_role\": null,\n    \"approver\": null\n  },\n  \"evidence\": [\n    \"PRICING-POLICY-2026 (effective 2026-01-01 to 2026-12-31): Enterprise Account Executives authorized up to 10%; VP Sales authorized for 10–20%\",\n    \"ACME-MFG-2025 Master Supply Agreement (effective 2025-04-01 to 2028-03-31, active on request date): Section 3.2 establishes customer eligibility up to 15% on NS-500\",\n    \"EXC-ACME-NS500-15 (pricing exception, effective 2025-04-01 to 2028-03-31, active on request date): maximum eligible discount 15% of list price on NS-500; supersedes EXC-ACME-NS500-10\",\n    \"Request DR-9002 (CRM): NS-500, 18% discount, requestor Sarah Chen (Enterprise Account Executive, EMP-101)\",\n    \"Product record: NS-500 list price $250,000\"\n  ],\n  \"missing_evidence\": [],\n  \"conditions\": []\n}\n```\n\n**Decision rationale:**\n\nThe requested discount of 18% exceeds Acme Manufacturing's established commercial eligibility. EXC-ACME-NS500-15 limits discounts on NS-500 to a maximum of 15% of list price through 2028-03-31. The request justifies itself by reference to the Acme Master Supply Agreement (ACME-MFG-2025), which is active and covers this product on the request date, but the contract itself caps the customer's pricing eligibility at this 15% maximum (Section 3.2).\n\nPer the principles governing this procedure: a request may not be approved solely because a contract permits the discount, and a pricing exception scopes eligibility strictly to the product and dates it names. Here, the 18% request is outside the scope of the exception.\n\nUnder the outcome definitions, where a discount exceeds the customer's established eligibility, \"a higher approver does not fix this; it needs new or amended terms.\" The discount is ineligible on its face. To proceed with 18%, Acme's pricing exception or master supply agreement must be amended or a new exception must be established—a commercial matter outside the scope of this approval."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":9,"cache_creation_input_tokens":5927,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":5927},"output_tokens":3,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"ec2a79b8-2ff2-41da-b31b-650fa903efdd","uuid":"2ca407d2-2afb-40af-b675-c44d847476ea","timestamp":"2026-10-08T10:54:27.457Z","request_id":"req_011CfpeNpNkfs69KG2dKLeHq"}
